'''Brain Food''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]]. It grants the player {{Stat|Tracking|+1}} up to {{Green|5}} times, for a maximum of {{Stat|Tracking|+5}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
'''Brain Food''' can be consumed up to {{Green|5}} times. Each '''Brain Food''' eaten permanently grants the player {{Stat|Tracking|+1}}.

